<title>FRANCE: Eramet third quarter sales steady.</title>
<headline>Eramet third quarter sales steady.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>     Turnover				    883.3    vs     884.0</p>
<p>     of which</p>
<p>     Nickel					630.8    vs     580.8</p>
<p>     Steel					 252.5    vs     303.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures exclude 46 percent stake in Comilog.</p>
